<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="auth-wrap">
  <div style="text-align:center;max-width:520px;">
    <div class="brand" style="justify-content:center;margin-bottom:32px;">
      <div class="brand-logo" style="width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:16px;font-size:1.5rem;">UCB</div>
      <div class="brand-text">
        <span class="brand-name">United Credit Bank</span>
        <span class="brand-tag">🇦🇺 404 Not Found</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size:8rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:-0.05em;line-height:1;">404</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;">G'day — this page is out bush</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--text-gray);margin-bottom:32px;">We couldn't find the page you were looking for. Maybe a wombat borrowed it? Let's get you back to safe territory.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">🏠 Back to Homepage</a>
      <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">← Go Back</a>
      <a href="/user/dashboard" class="btn btn-light btn-lg">👤 My Dashboard</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
